{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Proper noun","language":"Translingual","definitions":[{"definition":"<span about=\"#mwt9\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">A taxonomic </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/genus#English\" title=\"genus\" about=\"#mwt9\">genus</a><span about=\"#mwt9\"> within the </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/family#English\" title=\"family\" about=\"#mwt9\">family</a><span about=\"#mwt9\"> </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Melanthiaceae#Translingual\" title=\"Melanthiaceae\" about=\"#mwt9\">Melanthiaceae</a><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\" about=\"#mwt9\">&nbsp;</span><span about=\"#mwt9\">– </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/herb_Paris\" title=\"herb Paris\" about=\"#mwt9\">herb Paris</a><span about=\"#mwt9\"> and its close relatives, native to Asia and Europe.</span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:mul:Taxonomic_names_(genus)#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt9\">"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Proper noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":""},{"definition":"The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/capital\" title=\"capital\">capital</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/large\" title=\"large\">largest</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/city\" title=\"city\">city</a> of <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/France#English\" title=\"France\">France</a></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Paris#PARIS\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Cities_in_France#PARIS\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:National_capitals#PARIS\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Places_in_France#PARIS\">."},{"definition":"<span about=\"#mwt60\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">A </span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/department\" title=\"department\" about=\"#mwt60\">department</a><span about=\"#mwt60\"> of </span><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt60\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Île-de-France#English\" title=\"Île-de-France\">Île-de-France</a></span><span about=\"#mwt60\">, </span><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt60\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/France#English\" title=\"France\">France</a></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Paris,_France#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt60\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Departments_of_Île-de-France,_France#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt60\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Places_in_Île-de-France,_France#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt60\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Places_in_France#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt60\">."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt61\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/government\" title=\"government\">government</a> of France."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Proper noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt123\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Trojan\" title=\"Trojan\">Trojan</a> prince who <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/elope\" title=\"elope\">eloped</a> with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Helen\" title=\"Helen\">Helen</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt124\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">A male <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/given_name\" title=\"given name\">given name</a> from Ancient Greek</span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:English_given_names#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt124\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:English_male_given_names#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt124\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:English_male_given_names_from_Ancient_Greek#PARIS\" about=\"#mwt124\">, from the Trojan hero."}]}]}